      "content": "To mitigate the situation, consider releasing a statement early tomorrow morning explaining the candidate's original vote and their current stance on the issue. You can say that they have since changed their mind and now support the funding bill, highlighting any efforts they've made to reverse their previous vote. This can help downplay the story's significance and provide a more positive narrative for the campaign. Additionally, having a clear, concise explanation will help your team prepare for future inquiries.",
